From a25f74f23786a541838bbca756d4666e22ef636d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 02:32:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 34/54] Opt-in command history sync setting in embedded builds

Adds `host.history_sync` (off by default) and a "Sync command history" toggle on the Privacy
page. The host app does the syncing: it shares the newest commands through VS Code Settings Sync
and merges other machines' commands into its history before Warp loads it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
